span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Sinmyeong Taemyeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 본교 추천</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">인원 : 00명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span><strong> 2. 소요경비</strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Sinmyeong Taemyeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 경상북도 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">지원사항 : 왕복항공료, 보험비(실손화재), </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Sinmyeong Taemyeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 본인부담 사항&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">∙ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Sinmyeong Taemyeongjo,한컴돋움\">비자발급 관련 수수료(300$정도) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Sinmyeong Taemyeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">∙ 초기정착금 : 대략 150만원~200만원 필요함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 인턴 근무조건 및 지원사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;∙ 주 40H, 시간당 8$(유급) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;∙ 한달 급여 : 대략 130~140만원 정도</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><strong>3. 신청자격</strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">❍ 해외인턴 신청자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;∙ 본교 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">재적생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">으로 30세 이하인 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;∙ 영어 언어구사 능력 우수자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">∙ 기업체 요구자격 기준에 합당한 자(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">기업체 면접有</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 173.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -173.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">❍ 인턴대상자 제외사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;∙ 기 참여자, 단순 어학연수 희망자, 비자발급 결격자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">∙ 지원 불가능한 학과(미국 비자불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">&nbsp;: 기계공학부, 전파공학과, 신소재공학부, 응용화학과</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 중도포기자 제재</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;∙ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">특별한 사유없이 본인의 귀책이 있는 경우 선발 후</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;지출된 보조금 환수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 제출서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 이력서(국문,영문) 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 자기소개서(국문,영문) 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 성적증명서(국문,영문) 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 서약 및 동의서 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 영어공인어학성적표 사본 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><strong>4. 원서 접수</strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 접수기간 : 2011년 7월 11일(월) ~ 20일(수) 17:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 접수장소 : 국제교류교육원 행정실(이오스관 112호) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 면접대상자 : 개별 통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 문의 : 국제교류교육원(478-7216 김혜진)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Human Myeongjo,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
